  "description": "Lee Yeon-ji, a manager at 'D for Love,' a company that combines adult products with escape room games, is asked by the CEO, Won Ha-jin, to provide feedback on a new product after achieving record-breaking sales. Although the manual contains a warning not to engage in penetration while at the office, Yeon-ji ignores it, and finds herself trapped inside the transformed D for Love escape room with four men...\n\n_Source: [RIDI Books](https://ridibooks.com/books/3587013875), translated_\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://ridibooks.com/books/3587013875)",
